(Leonard:)Well, that's Leo.

8
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:37,308
Hey, why don't you tell me
about your showcase last night?

9
00:00:37,471 --> 00:00:38,641
(Penny:)Oh, it was okay, I guess.

10
00:00:38,805 --> 00:00:41,345
